A("What majority is required in each House for amending the Constitution under Article 239?", "Two thirds of the total membership", ["Simple majority", "Three fourths of the members present", "Two thirds of the members present"], "Article 239(2) requires the Bill to be passed by at least two thirds of the total membership of each House.", "A change affecting the boundaries of a province also needs two thirds of that Provincial Assembly (Article 239(4)).")
