A("Under which Article of the 1973 Constitution is the command of the Armed Forces defined?", "Article 243", ["Article 244", "Article 245", "Article 242"], "Article 243 provides for the control and command of the Armed Forces, with the supreme command vested in the President.", "The 27th Amendment of 2025 rewrote this Article.")
A("Which Article of the 1973 Constitution contains the oath of the members of the Armed Forces?", "Article 244", ["Article 243", "Article 245", "Article 255"], "Article 244 requires every member of the Armed Forces to take the oath set out in the Third Schedule.", "The oath includes a promise not to engage in any political activities.")
A("Which Article lays down the functions of the Armed Forces, including acting in aid of civil power?", "Article 245", ["Article 243", "Article 244", "Article 232"], "Article 245 says the Armed Forces shall defend Pakistan against external aggression or threat of war and, subject to law, act in aid of civil power when called upon.", "Article 245(3) bars High Courts from issuing orders in areas where the Army is deployed.")
