A("Which Article of the 1973 Constitution provides for the Federal and Provincial Public Service Commissions?", "Article 242", ["Article 240", "Article 241", "Article 243"], "Article 242 requires the President to set up a Federal Public Service Commission, and each Governor a Provincial Public Service Commission.", "Article 240 deals with appointments to the services of Pakistan.")
A("Which Article of the 1973 Constitution says that no private organisation capable of functioning as a military organisation can be formed?", "Article 256", ["Article 245", "Article 255", "Article 257"], "Article 256 prohibits private armies and organisations of a military nature.", "Article 257 deals with the relationship between Pakistan and the State of Jammu and Kashmir.")
