A("Which Amendment of 2012 changed the appointment of the Chief Election Commissioner and caretaker governments?", "20th Amendment", ["19th Amendment", "21st Amendment", "22nd Amendment"], "The 20th Amendment (February 2012) provided for a caretaker setup and an independent Election Commission.", "The 22nd Amendment (2016) changed the qualifications of the Chief Election Commissioner and members.")
